<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want all our customers have an enjoyable journey when they travel with us, so I'm sorry to hear that there wasn’t a <em><strong>-gluten intolerant/vegetarian etc-</strong></em> option available for you onboard your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’ve always taken pride in the quality of the catering we offer on board, including the special meals we provide for customers with <em><strong>-dietary/religious-</strong></em> requirements.<br />
<br />
While we implement measures to minimise mishaps, human errors can still occasionally happen. I understand this must have been disappointing.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>A little something from us</strong><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em></p>

<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope that we can welcome you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>